# A list whose rows do not fit scrolls by the mouse wheel and by a finger (docs/formats/script.md; ADR 0011 point 5:
# the original's wheel reaches only the login's and the game creation's lists; ADR 0014: a finger's drag on a list is
# the wheel's rows, a tap a click). terran01's keystroke help (help.bin, its list help.1 with 51 rows, 13 shown): the wheel
# over the list moves it a row a notch both ways and stops at its ends, over the dialog beside the list it moves the
# dialog's only list, over the game view nothing; a finger dragged down shows the rows above, dragged up those below,
# and selects nothing; a tap selects the row under it. tools/ci.sh wants exit code 0 and "0 failures".
mission terran/terran01
options originals

wait game
# the tips at the game's start pause it: Return closes them
until nodialog key Return
menu help
wait dialog helpmenu
click control helpmenu.1
wait dialog help
wait frames 5
log help list.top list.selected
expect list.top == 0 and list.selected == 0
wheel -3 control help.1
wait frames 2
log down list.top
expect list.top == 3
wheel 1 control help.1
wait frames 2
expect list.top == 2
wheel 5 control help.1
wait frames 2
expect list.top == 0
wheel -100 control help.1
wait frames 2
log end list.top
mark end
wheel -1 control help.1
wait frames 2
expect list.top == @end.list.top
# the dialog's title beside the list, then the game view left of the dialog (logical x 50 on the narrowest screen too)
wheel 4 control help.-1
wait frames 2
expect list.top == @end.list.top - 4
wheel 4 50 200
wait frames 2
expect list.top == @end.list.top - 4
shot wheel
touch on
wait seconds 0.3
wheel 100 control help.1
wait frames 2
wheel -10 control help.1
wait frames 2
expect list.top == 10
# a finger dragged 80 pixels down shows the rows above
finger down 1 control help.1 0 -68
finger move 1 control help.1 0 -28
finger move 1 control help.1 0 12
finger up 1 control help.1 0 12
wait seconds 0.3
log drag-down list.top list.selected
mark drag
expect list.top < 10 and list.selected == 0
finger down 2 control help.1 0 32
finger move 2 control help.1 0 -8
finger move 2 control help.1 0 -48
finger up 2 control help.1 0 -48
wait seconds 0.3
log drag-up list.top list.selected
expect list.top == 10 and list.selected == 0
# a tap on the list's third row shown (its rows 16 pixels from its top 104 above its centre) selects it
tap 3 control help.1 0 -70
wait seconds 0.5
log tap list.top list.selected
expect list.top == 10 and list.selected == 12
shot tap
